Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.12,0:00:35.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.40,0:00:39.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.52,0:02:01.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hydemont attacked again, but we all\Nbanished him into the Gate of Destiny!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.72,0:02:04.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Afterward, Gennai said there was\Na really evil force out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.88,0:02:07.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'm pretty sure I\Ncan face anything now!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.52,0:02:14.98,Sign,,0,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\3c&H000000&}{\fs30\b1}{\fad(300,0)}The Last Evil Digimon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.18,0:02:38.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are we down?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.78,0:02:40.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.62,0:02:43.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this may be a stupid question.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.28,0:02:46.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how come we're not still falling?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.44,0:02:48.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.48,0:02:51.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Greetings.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.42,0:02:53.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope nobody needed a\Nbark bag on the way down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.02,0:02:54.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Gennai.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.93,0:02:57.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so you're the one who brought\Nus down here what do you want
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.64,0:03:00.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we already beat the dark masters\Nit's true that the evil of the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.94,0:03:03.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dark masters was destroyed but\Nthe source that created that evil
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.04,0:03:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,still exists and that source\Ncame from the wall of fire what's
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.86,0:03:13.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that when i was searching through\Nthe dino ruins i came across
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.66,0:03:17.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,an ancient inscription it told\Nof a time long ago when a strange
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.66,0:03:20.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,being appeared from behind the\Nwall of fire and it was angry
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.68,0:03:23.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you would be too if you who\Nlived with that kind of humidity.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.98,0:03:26.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The mere existence of this\Nbeing caused a warp in
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.72,0:03:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,space and time was thrown\Ncompletely out of whack.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.68,0:03:31.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It threatened the collapse\Nof the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.74,0:03:35.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And even worse than that, my\Nnew wristwatch stopped working.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.34,0:03:38.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Digimon knew they didn't have\Nthe strength to defeat this being,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.56,0:03:40.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so the original Digidestined\Nchildren were summoned
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.88,0:03:44.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,from the real world and\Ntogether they defeated the evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.08,0:03:44.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.06,0:03:49.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you mean that there were other\Nkids just like us before we came along?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.12,0:03:53.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we were summoned because something else\Ncame out from behind that wall of fire,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.30,0:03:54.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,didn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.21,0:03:55.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.13,0:03:55.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's the real enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.18,0:03:57.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.09,0:03:59.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But unfortunately, that's\Njust the good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.02,0:04:02.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bad news is it also\Ntold of a great darkness
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.70,0:04:04.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that will blanket the\Nentire digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.94,0:04:05.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A great darkness?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.80,0:04:08.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't look now, but it's pretty dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.62,0:04:10.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So is this the enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.44,0:04:12.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In a way, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.98,0:04:17.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I believe he has a form as well.\NHe's, uh... Uh-oh. I'm out of quarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.88,0:04:19.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotta go. See ya, Gennai!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.54,0:04:21.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, great,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.45,0:04:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,how does he expect us\Nto fight this thing when
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.90,0:04:24.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we don't even know what\Nit is we're looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.98,0:04:25.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just my luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.89,0:04:29.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The second I start enjoying my vacation,\Nanother monster tries to destroy the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.42,0:04:30.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.33,0:04:32.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but something tells me this isn't gonna be
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.08,0:04:34.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like any other Digimon\Nwe've ever run into.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.78,0:04:35.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, so what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.96,0:04:39.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The first Digidestined kids were\Nable to defeat something like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.36,0:04:40.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, then, so will we.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.64,0:04:41.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.94,0:04:42.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.85,0:04:45.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll just have to find a way to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.98,0:04:49.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.18,0:04:50.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like a moose.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.60,0:04:53.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds to me like it's\Ncoming from every direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.24,0:04:55.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.34,0:04:56.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what does it mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.96,0:04:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.60,0:05:01.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have the power\Nto eliminate my sadness.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.78,0:05:02.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.66,0:05:11.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll bet this has something to do with\Nthat Digimon gen I was talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.34,0:05:13.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either that or it's a giant cube puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.42,0:05:29.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the ultimate evil, complete\Nwith hot and cold running water.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.10,0:05:31.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What on earth is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.10,0:05:34.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am Apocalymon, a mutant Digimon.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:32.26,0:05:42.27,Sign,ANALYZER,0,0,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}Apocalymon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:32.26,0:05:42.27,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,135,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Ultimate
Dialogue: 1,0:05:32.26,0:05:42.27,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,175,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Attribute Unknown
Dialogue: 1,0:05:32.26,0:05:42.27,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,230,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Type Unknown
Dialogue: 1,0:05:32.26,0:05:42.27,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,310,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:05:32.26,0:05:42.27,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,350,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Total Darkness\N(Darkness Zone)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.02,0:05:38.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My darkness zone attack transforms\Nmy enemy into nothingness.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.52,0:05:42.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have the power to turn everything\NI touch into total darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.14,0:05:44.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I will start with Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.62,0:05:47.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I better get a new flashlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.48,0:05:48.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what about...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.12,0:05:50.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The... kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.72,0:05:54.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora! Or Mimi?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.94,0:06:02.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you repulsed by my appearance?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.14,0:06:06.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be afraid to hurt my feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.42,0:06:07.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're already hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.64,0:06:13.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, I was created from all that\Nwas lost during the Digivolving process.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.22,0:06:14.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by loss?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.84,0:06:18.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon have been Digivolving for\Nmany years now, over and over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.76,0:06:22.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there were some who worked up to\Nthe challenge and simply disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.38,0:06:23.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.60,0:06:27.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even on Earth, some species became\Nextinct during the process of evolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.30,0:06:29.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, the Tasmanian tiger\Nwolf was one of those...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.54,0:06:30.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.26,0:06:36.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's the one telling this\Nstory anyway, me or you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.30,0:06:37.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.78,0:06:39.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, I have a question to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.40,0:06:42.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you believe that I am\Nworthy of coexisting with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.10,0:06:44.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, well, yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.72,0:06:45.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.04,0:06:49.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though I was forged from\Nthe pain and misery of all the
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.38,0:06:53.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ill-fated Digimon who vanished\Nwhile attempting to Digivolve?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.16,0:06:55.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're entirely made\Nup of grief and sorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.98,0:06:56.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How sad for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.10,0:06:58.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, rub it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.60,0:07:01.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now, Digidestined and Digimon,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.76,0:07:04.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have been waiting an\Neternity for this encounter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.32,0:07:06.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.23,0:07:07.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.38,0:07:11.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I sat alone in the cold,\Nmiserable darkness of my world,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.00,0:07:16.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I watched all of you on the other side,\Nlaughing and having fun in the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.44,0:07:20.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, now it's my turn to shine!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.00,0:07:27.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is everybody okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.06,0:07:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think so. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.88,0:07:30.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm okay, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.44,0:07:32.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.94,0:07:34.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Answer me this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.72,0:07:40.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do all of you get the\Npizza while I get the crust?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.70,0:07:42.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't take all these metaphors!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.30,0:07:47.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take these children and use their\Nfear to make them digital and disappear!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.48,0:07:53.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Answer me this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.56,0:07:56.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why should you get to laugh\Nwhen I am forced to cry?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.00,0:08:01.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think it's fair that I should\Nhave to live with all this agony?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.68,0:08:04.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you get to taste\Nthe best life has to
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.12,0:08:06.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,offer while all I do is\Nchoke on its leftovers?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.68,0:08:12.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, this guy really holds a grudge.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.66,0:08:15.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will rule the world and\Nplunge it into darkness so
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.04,0:08:19.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that I don't have to be\Nalone anymore in my misery.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.62,0:08:24.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, what am I laughing at?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.42,0:08:26.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm supposed to be depressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.30,0:08:27.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,River of power!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.76,0:08:31.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.78,0:08:32.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.12,0:08:33.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.32,0:08:35.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.56,0:08:38.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was Metal Seadramon with\Nhis classic river of power.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.12,0:08:41.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now here's Myotismon\Nwith his number one hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.98,0:08:43.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crimson Lightning!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.68,0:08:51.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next, Machinedramon, Giga Cannon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.92,0:08:57.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Inconceivable.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.83,0:09:00.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's using all the attacks of the evil\NDigimon we've defeated in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.00,0:09:03.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean we have to fight\Nthem all over again?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.08,0:09:05.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the worst recurring\Nnightmare I've ever been awake for.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.06,0:09:09.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, we were able to beat\Nthem once. Sora's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.38,0:09:10.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We did beat them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.62,0:09:11.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we can do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.18,0:09:14.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just have to fight together as a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.24,0:09:16.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.26,0:09:18.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've sacrificed too much to give up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.28,0:09:21.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You fools, you haven't even\Nseen my true power yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.52,0:09:24.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reverse Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.40,0:09:37.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make you understand how it feels\Nto be one step closer to extinction.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.52,0:09:47.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're rookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.34,0:09:50.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He changed them back so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.14,0:09:51.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, TK.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.76,0:09:53.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not your fault, Patamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.30,0:09:54.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's his. Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.72,0:09:56.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This time, we're finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.52,0:09:58.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better lose that toot, Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.54,0:10:01.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just because we're at the rookie level\Ndoesn't mean we still can't fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.60,0:10:03.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We digivolve if we have the energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.50,0:10:04.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.41,0:10:05.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Start from scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.33,0:10:06.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can digivolve again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.40,0:10:07.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd have to eat something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.84,0:10:09.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, I am kind of hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.82,0:10:10.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget food.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.73,0:10:11.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have the power within us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.84,0:10:13.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we need your help. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.20,0:10:18.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody get your crests ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.34,0:10:19.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Death Claw!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.52,0:10:34.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our Crests!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.14,0:10:36.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He broke them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.36,0:10:39.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They won't be able to\NDigivolve without them!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.72,0:10:41.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you learned your lesson!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.30,0:10:42.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Always save your receipts!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.62,0:10:44.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The warranty was probably\Nstill good on those things!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.76,0:10:49.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't this usually the time when one\Nof us comes up with a brilliant idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.70,0:10:51.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think anything can\Nsave us this time, Joe!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.06,0:10:53.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid we're done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.12,0:11:15.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can we fight Apocalymon\Nwithout Digivolving?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.62,0:11:16.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.06,0:11:19.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the rookie Digimon combined\Ncouldn't defeat an enemy
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.82,0:11:22.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who has the power of all the\Nevil Digimon from the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.56,0:11:25.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,how can you be so sure\Nthere's got to be a way
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.16,0:11:27.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,somehow how did the\Noriginal Digidestined kids
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.02,0:11:31.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,defeat this enemy i'll\Ntake these children and
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.32,0:11:34.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,use their fear to make\Nthem digital and disappear
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.68,0:11:46.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what's this fascinating\Nour bodies are being broken
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.02,0:11:50.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,down into little bits of\Ndigital information Fascinating!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.34,0:11:51.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's stay calm, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.82,0:11:53.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't fall to pieces! Too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.68,0:12:09.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.92,0:12:11.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're information now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.44,0:12:13.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is where all digital\Ninformation gathers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.74,0:12:15.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the world of data. Data?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.76,0:12:17.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm too young to be dating!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.46,0:12:18.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.42,0:12:22.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sometimes too much information's\Na bad thing. Can we get back?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.70,0:12:25.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i don't know kari nothing like\Nthis has ever happened to us
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.52,0:12:29.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,before i don't know what to\Ndo is this it have we lost i'd
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.38,0:12:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,say that's a pretty good conclusion\Ncome on you guys don't quit
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.44,0:12:36.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now why not we can't stop\Nfighting now just because of a
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.56,0:12:39.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,little setback so what we're bits\Nof information we have no tags
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.02,0:12:42.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and crests we can't digivolve and\Nwe're facing the most powerful
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.86,0:12:45.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,enemy of all time i don't see\Nwhat the problem is Listen,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.82,0:12:46.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beaumont,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.73,0:12:48.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you guys have a great attitude\Nabout this whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.76,0:12:51.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But all the positive thinking\Nin the world can't guarantee
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.36,0:12:53.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that we'll find a way to get\Nback to our original forms.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.88,0:12:57.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I tried positive thinking once,\Nand I was positive about one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.08,0:12:58.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I positively hated it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.86,0:13:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speaking scientifically, we're the\Nfirst humans to be digitally processed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.28,0:13:05.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Technically, we're\Npioneers, like Marco Polo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.66,0:13:07.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know what he's famous for.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.98,0:13:15.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In every battle, you're bound\Nto face a number of unknowns.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.70,0:13:16.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.61,0:13:18.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you didn't know how those\Nother fights would turn out,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.26,0:13:19.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you fought them anyway, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.02,0:13:20.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.06,0:13:21.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We did fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.10,0:13:26.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I first got to the digital world, I\Nwas afraid of any little thing that moved.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.34,0:13:28.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We faced all kinds of new monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.66,0:13:32.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But no matter who they threw at us, we\Nalways found the strength to beat the enemy,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.62,0:13:34.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,regardless of how big it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.22,0:13:35.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't we, Joe?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.13,0:13:36.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right, we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.64,0:13:38.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We worked together as a team,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.50,0:13:41.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even that time when we almost\Nlost TK because he couldn't swim.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.98,0:13:44.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, I forgot that\NI couldn't swim, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.80,0:13:51.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember times when all I wanted\Nto do was break down and cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.70,0:13:54.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But instead, you fought\Non with your new friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.70,0:13:57.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel like I've become a stronger\Nperson since I met all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.04,0:14:01.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like that time at the convention center\Nwhen all those Gokimon were attacking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.60,0:14:03.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't cry a single drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.08,0:14:05.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, maybe just one drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.36,0:14:12.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before I met you, TK, I didn't think it\Nmattered if I ever digivolved or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.20,0:14:17.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When Devimon went to grab you and got\Nme, I knew it was my time to shine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.64,0:14:21.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I became Angemon for the first time\Nand I've been flying high ever since.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.38,0:14:23.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I learned something\Nfrom you, too, Patamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.18,0:14:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I learned that sometimes you have\Nto fight for what you believe in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.98,0:14:33.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to know you've changed\Nmy life in many ways, too, Sora.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.58,0:14:34.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.49,0:14:35.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.76,0:14:38.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, I've never\Nhad a best friend before.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.14,0:14:39.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would do anything for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.06,0:14:41.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like that time I took my other's mom's
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.78,0:14:44.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crimson Lightning attached\Nright in the chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.52,0:14:46.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talk about heartburn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.50,0:14:50.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, Izzy, when I first met you,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.48,0:14:52.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you were just one\Nof those computer geeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.48,0:14:56.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But after I got to know you, I realized\Nyou are one of those computer geeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.12,0:14:57.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm glad you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.48,0:15:00.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because where would the\Nrest of us be without you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.50,0:15:01.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.82,0:15:03.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promised myself I wouldn't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.40,0:15:08.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although I wanted to cry when I felt that\Nasteroid belt tightening around my waist,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.30,0:15:10.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you and I took care\Nof Motimon together!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.20,0:15:15.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for you, Matt, you\Ndon't have to say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.84,0:15:16.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.90,0:15:18.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was that time when...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.26,0:15:19.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.18,0:15:20.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.09,0:15:20.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then you and I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.01,0:15:21.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.92,0:15:22.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember when we...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.83,0:15:23.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.75,0:15:25.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said you don't have to say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.14,0:15:30.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and I knew from the beginning that\Ntogether we made an invincible team,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.72,0:15:31.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right, Tai?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.63,0:15:32.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got that right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.76,0:15:36.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, I probably could have\Ntaken care of Etemon without you,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.28,0:15:40.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it was nice having you around,\Nand you did get me out of a few jams.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.92,0:15:44.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't give up now, because if we do,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.60,0:15:47.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what was the whole point of searching\Nfor Kari in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.74,0:15:48.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got them, Mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.66,0:15:51.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've waited my whole life to\Nmeet you and find my purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.72,0:15:54.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and that is to protect you\Nno matter what the cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.44,0:15:57.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whether that meant facing my\NOtis Mon's prison wing attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.12,0:16:02.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or facing the reality\Nof losing Wizard Mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.68,0:16:08.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I will always be there for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.84,0:16:12.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, if I had never met you, Gatomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.64,0:16:15.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if I had never come\Nto the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.28,0:16:18.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if none of us became\Nfriends in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.36,0:16:21.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we wouldn't have become\Nthe people that we are today.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.70,0:16:25.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right, and we never would have\Nwon all those battles without each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.08,0:16:26.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel like I've grown up a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.26,0:16:29.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we've all grown\Nup in a lot of ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.10,0:16:31.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've grown up too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.24,0:16:32.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a much better fighter now
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.36,0:16:38.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.36,0:16:40.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, for Earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.42,0:16:45.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're so proud of you no matter\Nwhat happens. Give it your all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.02,0:16:57.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know about you, but\NI'm not ready to quit yet
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.78,0:16:58.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm with you, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.10,0:17:01.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't let this whole\Nexperience be for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.62,0:17:02.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.66,0:17:05.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no way I'm about\Nto let my friends down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.48,0:17:09.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And besides, there are still a lot of\Npeople counting on us down on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.68,0:17:11.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's find a way. Let's fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.58,0:17:13.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.68,0:17:15.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've reached the point where\Nthere's no turning back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.02,0:17:18.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Press or no press, we're going to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.64,0:17:24.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? My heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.62,0:17:37.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's your crest you don't\Nneed to carry them anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.46,0:17:39.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because their power has been\Ninside of you this whole
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.70,0:17:44.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,time you mean like in our\Nhearts prodigious that makes
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.54,0:17:46.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,perfect sense it's like my\Nknowledge and joe's sense
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.98,0:17:49.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of responsibility if your\Nspecial traits are within
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.40,0:17:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you then you don't need your\Ncrest because your power
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.48,0:17:55.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,will be within you as well\Nyou're wrong huh it wasn't
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.12,0:17:57.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the friendship inside of\Nme that made my crest glow,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.32,0:17:58.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izzy, it was more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.66,0:18:01.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The friendship I felt from all\Nof you gathered inside my heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.50,0:18:03.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and that brought the\Npower of my crest to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.72,0:18:06.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So each person's crest\Nisn't powered by themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.44,0:18:09.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's powered by the faith\Nwe have in each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.16,0:18:11.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then the light inside\Nof me is for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.82,0:18:25.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And everyone's hopes are my hopes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.62,0:18:32.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.42,0:18:34.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angemon, Digiball 2!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.02,0:18:40.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angemon Digiball 2!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.14,0:18:46.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sagna Angemon! Knowledge!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.60,0:18:49.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angemon Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.18,0:18:52.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kabuterimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.58,0:18:55.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kabuterimon, Digivolve to
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.68,0:19:01.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mega Kabuterimon Sincerity!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.44,0:19:06.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tokomon Digivolve to Tokomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.06,0:19:13.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tokomon Digivolve to Digivolve to
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.88,0:19:17.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lillymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.28,0:19:19.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reliability!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.68,0:19:23.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robomon Digiball 2!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.74,0:19:26.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Itakumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.66,0:19:29.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Itakumon! Digiball 2!
